/K [12]
>>
endobj
145 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 43 0 R
/E (Yes. As per the rules of golf and universal golf etiquette, there must be a minimum of 2 \(two\) players per flight on weekdays and a minimum of 3 \(three\) players per flight on weekends and holidays. The maximum number of players per flight is 4 \(four\), on any day. )
/Pg 12 0 R
/K [13]
>>
endobj
